# Copy to arbora.env (never commit the copy). Every line is optional.
#
# Shared envelope HMAC between arbora and its engine. Generate once:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# Unset = generated per install; the doctor flags it for rotation.
# GRAPH_SERVICE_AUTH_SECRET=
#
# First-run setup code for local/external mode. Unset = generated at start and
# written to the arbora log; only someone who can read the log can create the
# first administrator.
# ARBORA_SETUP_CODE=
